{
  "id": 8834328592583,
  "title": "Personalized Basketball Close Up Blanket with Name and Number",
  "handle": "personalized-basketball-close-up-blanket-with-name-and-number-3f49346de1-3f49346de1",
  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself or your favorite basketball lover in cozy warmth with this personalized basketball throw blanket from Jeminise. Featuring a bold design of basketball player silhouettes, this custom blanket is the perfect addition to any sports enthusiast's collection, bringing comfort and personalized style to game days, napping, or lounging on the sofa.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with your own custom name and number for a truly unique sports gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Fabric:</strong> Crafted from super soft polyester, available in either plush fleece or warm sherpa fabric options.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Sizes:</strong> Choose from four convenient sizes including Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Multi-Purpose Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor snuggling, reading on the couch, travel, camping, or picnicking.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; dries quickly and stays fluffy for long-lasting use.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Fleece/Sherpa</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Basketball Blanket 6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Travel Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Basketball, Game</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Sport Type</th>\n<td>Basketball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small/Medium/Large/X-Large</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Summer</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
